               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_45b12f39">34.5 x 27.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_1ed52f4f">Written in brown ink. Paper: 24 staves. Both versions dated: "9/2 45.".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_0b16356e">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_c39ad197">
                  <p xml:id="idm36">On the same bifolio as "Vise om de onde Qvinder" (HartW B 16), "Roselille" (HartW B 11), "Agnete" (HartW B 7), "Strofe-Anti-Strofe" (HartW B 12), "Ebbe Skammelsøn" (HartW B 13), "Sang af 'Gorm den Gamle'" (HartW B 17), and "Hafbur og Signe" (HartW B 18). Contains two different versions called "Elveskud a" and "Elveskud c". Above the a-version, Hartmann has written "NB. Mariboes Kilde Kong Olaf den Hellige Greven og Kongedatteren", the rest has been cut away. The a-version in 3/8 is the one, that was printed. The c-version in 2/4 which is a different tune remained unpublished.</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
